This directory contains Alembic migrations for the Midnight Walk server.

Run migrations locally with:

```bash
# From the project root directory
cd midnight_walk
alembic upgrade head
```

Or from the project root:

```bash
alembic -c midnight_walk/alembic.ini upgrade head
```

For Heroku/Docker deployments:

```bash
heroku run "python -m alembic -c /opt/midnight/alembic.ini upgrade head" -a <your-app-name>
```

Ensure `DATABASE_URL` (or `MIDNIGHT_DB_PATH` for SQLite) is set so the migrations
connect to the correct database. Alembic will automatically pick up the URL via
`midnight_walk.database.get_database_url()`.

Note: The `alembic.ini` file uses `script_location = alembic` which works when
running from the `midnight_walk/` directory or in Docker/Heroku where the
alembic directory is at the root of the extracted bundle.
